{%- comment -%}
  LBASS — BLOG INDEX (2026-08-03)

  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
  Audited 2026-08-03: https://www.lbassoriginal.com/blogs/news returned HTTP 404
  while being listed in sitemap_blogs_1.xml (lastmod 2026-06-21). The theme had
  no templates/blog.liquid and no templates/article.liquid at all, so Shopify
  404'd the URL its own sitemap was advertising — a crawl-budget leak and a
  trust signal against the domain.

  It also meant the store had ZERO capability to publish articles, which is the
  main lever for Darija/French/Arabic informational search and for getting cited
  by answer engines. Guides are what LLMs quote; product pages are not.

  Adding this template makes /blogs/* return 200 and renders a real index even
  while the blog has no posts yet (see the empty state below — it links onward
  instead of dead-ending).
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="crumb" aria-label="مسار التصفح">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">الرئيسية</a> ›
    <span aria-current="page">{{ blog.title }}</span>
  </nav>

  <h1>{{ blog.title }}</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--txt2);max-width:70ch;margin:0 0 6px">
    أدلة ومقالات من Lbass Original على شراء حوايج second-hand أصلية فالمغرب — كيفاش تعرف الحالة، كيفاش تختار القياس، وكيفاش تشري بثقة.
  </p>
  <p style="color:var(--txt3);font-size:13.5px;max-width:70ch;margin:0 0 22px">
    Guides sur la friperie en ligne au Maroc · Guides to buying second-hand branded clothing in Morocco
  </p>

  {% paginate blog.articles by 12 %}
    {% if blog.articles_count > 0 %}
      <div class="grid">
        {% for article in blog.articles %}
          <a class="card" href="{{ article.url }}">
            <div class="card-img">
              {% if article.image %}
                <img src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 500 }}"
                     alt="{{ article.title | escape }} — Lbass Original"
                     loading="lazy" width="500" height="625">
              {% else %}
                <span style="font-size:56px;opacity:.35">✎</span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-vendor">{{ article.published_at | date: '%d.%m.%Y' }}</div>
              <div class="card-title">{{ article.title }}</div>
              {% if article.excerpt_or_content != blank %}
                <p style="color:var(--txt2);font-size:13px;margin:6px 0 0;line-height:1.7">
                  {{ article.excerpt_or_content | strip_html | truncate: 110 }}
                </p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% render 'lbass-pagination', paginate: paginate %}
    {% else %}
      {%- comment -%}
        Honest empty state. The blog is indexed, so this must never be a blank
        page — it routes to the guides that DO exist rather than dead-ending.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;background:var(--ink2);max-width:820px">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0">مازال ما نشرناش مقالات فهاد القسم.</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--txt2);margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.85">
          حتى يتعمر، شوف الأدلة اللي كاينين دابا — فيهم كلشي على الحالة، القياس، والتوصيل.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="chip" href="/pages/condition-guide">دليل الحالة</a>
          <a class="chip" href="/pages/size-guide">كيفاش نعرف القياس ديالي</a>
          <a class="chip" href="/pages/authenticity">الأصالة والفحص</a>
          <a class="chip" href="/pages/shipping-and-payment">الدفع عند الاستلام</a>
          <a class="chip" href="/pages/comment-acheter-second-hand-original-maroc">كيفاش تشري second-hand أصلي</a>
          <a class="chip" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">شوف كل القطع</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endpaginate %}

  <nav style="margin:26px 0 0" aria-label="أقسام أخرى">
    <p style="color:var(--txt3);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px">تصفح القطع المتوفرة 👇</p>
    {% for c in collections %}
      {% unless c.handle == 'frontpage' or c.handle contains 'audited-drop' %}
        {% if c.products_count > 0 %}<a class="chip" href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.title }}</a>{% endif %}
      {% endunless %}
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Blog",
  "name": {{ blog.title | json }},
  "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ blog.url }}",
  "inLanguage": "ar-MA",
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Lbass Original",
    "url": {{ shop.url | json }}
  }{% if blog.articles_count > 0 %},
  "blogPost": [
    {% for article in blog.articles limit: 12 %}
    {
      "@type": "BlogPosting",
      "headline": {{ article.title | json }},
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ article.url }}",
      "datePublished": {{ article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | json }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]{% endif %}
}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"الرئيسية","item":{{ shop.url | json }}},
    {"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ blog.title | json }},"item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ blog.url }}"}
  ]
}
</script>
